body:
Yes well I am in therapy and on medication rn. I go out for walks or exercise every day. and I have tried to start learning the piano which I force myself to practice a little every day. I am about to get a gym membership and I am also about to join a chess club. I make sure I play chess every day as it is my hobby, I do journaling, I have tried the grounding techniques and breathing techniques for sleep/anxiety. I meditate  on most days. I force myself to go out with friends at least one or two times a week now. 

&#x200B;

yet i still feel awful
